text:
I honestly thought there would be a minor abuse platform to share this

I looked for a minor abuse board but came up with zero, which saddened me as I am sure that there are many people like me who look for that.  I was 9 when this incident happened.  I am sat here, writing this, looking at the google map image of the place where my assault happened.  The assault shaped my whole life when it comes to sex and men.  It is only now, as a 40 something, that I can realise just how impactful that time in my life was.  

&amp;#x200B;

I was playing, as 9 year olds do, dancing around, I was probably thinking  I was a pony, and then some boys biked up and trapped me on an external staircase.  I don't remember what they said, but I remember that I didn't understand it, and they were laughing at me and I didn't understand why.  I started up the stairs to my apartment and the next thing I remember was being chin to the stairs.  I was so confused as to why I was lying there, and I tried to get up but was pulled down.  Every time I attempted to move I was stopped.  I remember hearing my own breath in my head, trying to work out what was happening and why anyone would want to hurt me.  

&amp;#x200B;

I started kicking out as I was so confused and after a hand up my skirt I was let go.  I went to run to my parents but quickly realised that I didn't even have the vocabulary to explain what had happened.  Instead I eventually came back down and then sat up on an electricity box and kicked my heels and pretended that all was fine.

&amp;#x200B;

I live with the feeling of sitting, dejected, on a concrete step, feeling that I had just been taught that I had no power over my own life decisions.  

&amp;#x200B;

I am not ready to talk about what happened next.  I am very proud of myself for even committing the above, in the skeletal way that it is, to a public audience.

&amp;#x200B;

Shit...that was way more heavy than I thought it would be, and I am still sitting looking at the Google image of those steps and the electricity box.
